  "item_short_desc": "<p>When planning for an exciting adventure, you shouldn&rsquo;t have to worry about fitting everything into one pack. Our Canvas Duffle Bag with Side Zipper offers an all-in-one place to carry your equipment and gear. From storing camping essentials, to lugging around sporting goods, this heavy-duty military bag will handle it all!</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "9557",
  "description": "<p>When planning for an exciting adventure, you shouldn&rsquo;t have to worry about fitting everything into one pack. Our Canvas Duffle Bag with Side Zipper offers an all-in-one place to carry your equipment and gear. From storing camping essentials, to lugging around sporting goods, this heavy-duty military bag will handle it all! Top Grade Canvas: Made from Rothco&rsquo;s durable heavyweight canvas fabric, this superior material is naturally water-resistant, rugged, and is built for the long haul. These sports duffle bags are made of 100% cotton canvas weighing 22 oz. (Woodland Camo is 18 oz.), ensuring that your gear stays protected. No one comes close to Rothco&rsquo;s collection of premium canvas bags and packs. Safe &amp; Secure: These travel duffle bags feature a horizontal two-way side zipper for convenient access to your equipment, allowing you to easily pack larger items by sliding the bag over from the side. The heavy-duty zippers are designed to withstand rugged outdoor use, and will last through the test of time. Various Carry Options: The top and 2 side grab handles are double reinforced with box X stitching and extra canvas fabric underneath and on the top. This added support allows you to comfortably carry heavier loads without the risk of the handles breaking. The 2 d-rings at the ends also feature the reinforced stitching, and give you the option to add a shoulder strap (not included) or additional accessories and gear. Multipile Sizes Available: These canvas duffle bags come in 3 sizes: Standard (84 Liters) = 21 inch x 36 inch / Jumbo (142 Liters) = 25 inch x 42 inch / Giant (266 Liters) = 30 inch x 50 inch.</p>",
